    {"id":"title","type":"text","x":80,"y":40,"width":900,"height":35,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0f172a","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":1,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"IP-SAKTI SAHAYAK — END-TO-END RAG SYSTEM","fontSize":28,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"IP-SAKTI SAHAYAK — END-TO-END RAG SYSTEM","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"sub","type":"text","x":82,"y":82,"width":850,"height":25,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#475569","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":2,"version":1,"versionNonce":2,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Citation-grounded AYUSH and intellectual-property information assistant","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Citation-grounded AYUSH and intellectual-property information assistant","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"id":"main","type":"text","x":90,"y":145,"width":1120,"height":2460,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#334155","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":3,"version":1,"versionNonce":3,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"1. INPUT LAYER\n  User → React + Vite frontend (Vercel)\n  Question • jurisdiction • language • optional formulation details\n\n↓\n\n2. API AND QUERY PROCESSING\n  FastAPI backend (Render)\n  JWT • Pydantic • CORS/access control • PII scrubbing\n  Intent • jurisdiction • IP domain • formulation • risk classification\n\n↓\n\n3. ROUTING DECISION\n  Conversational → Gemini with disclaimer\n  Out-of-scope/unsafe → safe refusal or redirection\n  Legal/IP/AYUSH → continue to RAG\n\n↓\n\n4. HYBRID RETRIEVAL — QDRANT CLOUD\n  Preserve legal terms and extract entities\n  Dense: Hugging Face BAAI/bge-m3, 1,024 dimensions\n  Sparse: Qdrant BM25 vector\n  Collection: ragvyn_prod_v2\n  Metadata filters → dense + sparse search → RRF\n\n↓\n\n5. EVIDENCE VALIDATION\n  Relevance • jurisdiction • authority • document type\n  Section/article • page • source URL • evidence strength\n  Weak evidence → retry; still insufficient → abstain\n  Strong evidence → verified evidence pack\n\n↓\n\n6. GROUNDED GENERATION\n  Google Gemini receives only the verified evidence pack\n  No invented laws, sections, authorities or sources\n  Plain-language answer with limitations and citations\n\n↓\n\n7. POST-GENERATION VERIFICATION\n  Claim-evidence matching • citation validation\n  Unsupported-claim check • confidence • safety/scope check\n  Disclaimer and human escalation recommendation\n\n↓\n\n8. DATA PERSISTENCE AND AUDIT\n  Supabase PostgreSQL: users, conversations, messages, audit, metadata\n  Supabase Storage: private uploaded documents\n\n↓\n\n9. VERIFIED OUTPUT\n  Answer • applicable law • clickable citations\n  Confidence • next step • escalation\n  “This tool provides general information and is not legal advice.”","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.35},
    {"id":"ingest","type":"text","x":90,"y":2720,"width":1120,"height":260,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#0f172a","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"roundness":null,"seed":4,"version":1,"versionNonce":4,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"SUPPORTING PIPELINE — KNOWLEDGE-BASE INGESTION\nAuthoritative laws, treaties, TKDL material, ABS rules, regulations, registry records and case law\n→ source manifest, jurisdiction, authority, version and checksum\n→ parsing, legal-aware chunking, page/section preservation\n→ duplicate and metadata checks; exclude unverified material\n→ BAAI/bge-m3 dense vectors + BM25 sparse vectors\n→ Qdrant Cloud collection: ragvyn_prod_v2","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":1,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.35}
